Source: the fixes of master of gearman/gearmand after 2.2.0, 2.2.0..6b960b01
(15.11.2026), the code of these commits without their tests, CI and documents:
  ce6507f0 Close worker connection when the GRAB_JOB reply times out
  358644af gearman: do not divide by a zero WORK_STATUS denominator
  f1aba2c9 Give background jobs with an empty unique ID their own queue key
  295146fd libgearman: refuse the SSL option in builds without SSL
  9d60a37a libgearman: do not block on one connection in _client_run_tasks()
  43d926be gearmand: end the I/O thread loop on shutdown even with timers left
  3f765622 libgearman: apply the SSL option before connecting for EXCEPTION

